# --- SDDK companion ignore (v3.3) ---
# Mirrors the SDDK Local-Only Artifact Policy for tools that read .ignore
# instead of consulting .gitignore directly.
#
# These paths are developer-local workflow artifacts. They must never appear
# in git diffs, PRs, or code reviews. They are intentionally excluded from
# version control per user decision (2026-06-24).

sddk/
openspec/changes/
docs/ROADMAP.md
plans/
sdd/
